f-chain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Branch}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Branch}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}branch} \\vdash \\mathrm{Branch}_S(b,T,\\leq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Tree}(T,\\leq_T)\\land b\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(b,T,\\leq_T)\\land\\forall c\\;\\bigl(b\\subseteq c\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(c,T,\\leq_T)\\to c=b\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}branch} \\vdash \\mathrm{Branch}_S(b,T,\\leq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Tree}(T,\\leq_T)\\land b\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(b,T,\\leq_T)\\land\\forall c\\;\\bigl(b\\subseteq c\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(c,T,\\leq_T)\\to c=b\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree}(T,\\leq_T)$ (reflexive tree-order predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Chain}(b,T,\\leq_T)$ (chain pr